sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a ReserveNowRequest for a specific ConnectorType

    CSMS->>CS: ReserveNowRequest (connectorType, idToken, evseId omitted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be omitted<br>connectorType must be Configured connectorType<br>idToken.idToken must be Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken<br>idToken.type must be Configured valid_idtoken_type

    CS-->>CSMS: ReserveNowResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Reserved)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Reserved", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 4: CSMS responds accordingly
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
